Z||000000||Oreif||05-22-2000||06:42 PM||||Warning! There is a member of the Forum who has decided that he is going to be a U.S. Government <BR>Watchdog. If you have modified your vehicle, live in the U.S., and by his interpetation violated any<BR>U.S. EPA Clean Air Act laws, He has threatened to report persons to the EPA. He has went so far as to<BR>seek out the true names of Forum Members. He even stated he's turned the names into the EPA. <BR>What started as a simple question by a forum member turned into a basket case of flames, criminal accusations<BR>and mis-information. Now he is threatening to harass those that did not agree with his views by reporting them to the EPA.<BR> I for one am not going to play his silly games. I am not going to mention the members name. <BR>If he wants he can reveal himself. For all future purposes, My car is as stock as the <BR>day it rolled out of the factory plant. If the person wants to make false accustions to the EPA, let<BR>him. It's pretty sad state of affairs when a group of people who share a common intrest have to censor<BR>themselves for fear that some person may use it to harass them. <BR>I just wanted everyone to be aware the "big brother" is watching and taking names.<BR>Goodbye for now.||||reg||1
