Z||000002||DaRkLoRD||05-22-2000||06:59 PM||||I plan on doing a TON of modifications to my Fiero.. but <B>none</B> of them would increase the pollution, and several would even <B>decrease</B> it.. I normally hate the government messing around with things, but I do care about the environment. Of course, I'd never squeal on anyone for modifying an engine to get more power out at the expense of slightly higher emissions.. I'm just saying that's not something I'd do.<P>Then again, I'm in Canada and as far as I know, the american EPA has no presence here. so it's none of my concern anyway.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
