Z||000012||Phaeton||05-22-2000||10:37 PM||||Since you're all here anyway, here's a plea before I do it the hard way (trial and error after error).<P>The red Fiero upper plenum will not fit an aluminum head 3.1 lower plenum.  So a two inch spacer is made to adapt it on anyway 'cause it's way too cool to not use.<P>Will those desktop dyno's tell what that is going to do to the torque curve.  If that is a parameter that can be fed in then the rest of the engine numbers can be sent.<P>There is a fair amount of leeway in cross section and length and the amount of work is the same regardless, so I really want to do it the best it can be done on the first or second try.<P>I feel this is a pain in the arse type question, but I'm building the spacer anyway and expecting the torque to drop a few RPM's and flatten out.  That's with the same cross section, but with a secondary plenum box put there with the stock runners underneath, would this extra reservoir of air aid in higher RPM torque?<P>And all because it's bright red and says "FIERO" on it.<P>Thanks for being here, I'll post results even if it bites.||||reg||12
Z||000013||Sillhouette.com||05-22-2000||11:09 PM||||Hi all this thread about egr valves and lawyers was quite the funny story.  I love it to death.  In anyevent copies of internet cannot be used in a court of law.  They would have to sieze your personal computer with plans drawn up on how to modify your car for the purposes of soul air degredation and than you get yourself a fine for first offence.  <BR>Next...<BR>One must be very carefull who they piss off on the internet especially.  There are very easy ways to find people with this new superhighway of information and easy ways to get at them.  (These are not menant as a threat just as a warning for all).  The worst thing would be if someone picks and hurts not the person directly involved with this nonsense but someone dear to him or her.  Next things that are easy to mess up is credit history.  You can belong to any agency in the world if the banks get a wind of some bad credit your done for life.  You could be bleeding to death on the side of the road and since you got no money you'll be left there.   <BR>Don't give out personal information on the net either.  The biggest thing is your birthdate.  That is what banks and other goverment agencies use as a check if I'm talking to the right person part of their conversation.  Hope you all listen to this and stop the nonsense.  Trust me I know a bit about this stuff.  How I know about it well I'll let you use your immagination. <P>Regards||||reg||1
